Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:01.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}最近广州冒出了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:03.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}挺特别的参与模式
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:05.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}街上有家烧烤店
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:06.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}才开一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:08.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}附近五公里的居民
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:09.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}基本都成了它的{\c&H0057C8FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}回头客{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:11.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}{\c&H0066D1FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}80%{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}的顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:13.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}还主动加了店里的私域
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:15.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}生意好的不行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:16.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}我也跑去试了几次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:19.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}才明白这模式有多厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:20.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}普通烧烤店
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:21.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}搞充值活动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:23.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}充一百送十块
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:24.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}充两百送三十
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:25.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}早就过时了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:27.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}这家店推出了会员制
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:29.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}花49块就
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:30.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}能办个尊贵会员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}办完马上送一份招牌烧烤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.86,0:00:35.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}等于白送会员资格
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:37.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}所以大多数人都办了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:39.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}但重头戏是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}后面的共享店长活动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.98,0:00:42.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}半会员的顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}自动升级成小店长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:46.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,立刻拿到六张无门槛优惠\N券
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:48.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}小店长把券发到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:49.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}朋友圈或者群里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.94,0:00:52.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}别人一点券就成了他的粉\N丝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:00:55.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}以后这些粉丝到店消费
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.64,0:00:57.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}每一笔小店长都能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:58.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}拿{\c&H0066D1FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}10%{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}的现金奖励
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:00.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}而且秒到账
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:01.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}所有消费都是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:03.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}通过门店小程序完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:05.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}的老板不用费
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:06.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}心想推广方案
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.18,0:01:09.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}会员们就像{\c&H0057C8FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}免费{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}宣传员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:11.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}在社交圈里自然传播
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:12.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}这种口碑效果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:14.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}比花大钱打广告强多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:17.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}活动一推好几百人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:18.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}抢着办会员当小店长
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:20.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}既吃美食又赚外快
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.64,0:01:27.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}活动要落地靠人工
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.38,0:01:29.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}根本不行老板直接
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:31.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}换掉了旧系统上了一套智\N慧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:33.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}门店系统自动执行不用人\N管
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:36.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}除了餐饮水果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:37.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}生鲜美容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:39.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}便利店都能找它
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:42.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}如果你的店也想用这套系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.30,0:01:44.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}统搞活动评论区打个小店\N长就行
